# Tanaris (43-43): the Shimmering Flats and Gadgetzan, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/tanaris_43_43.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Tanaris, area 440, and the
# quest pages). The guide's quest list is section 4 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md; the
# other Tanaris quests are in Tanaris (44-44) and Tanaris & Dustwallow Marsh (47-48).
#
# Carried in: Rumors for Kravel, Goblin Sponsorship, Tran'rek and Stoley's Debt are taken in Booty
# Bay (Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows, 41-43); News for Fizzle (Martek the Exiled, Badlands)
# and Into the Field (Apothecary Zinge, Undercity) before these guides. Keeping Pace needs News for
# Fizzle, Slake That Thirst needs Into the Field.
#
# The route: a flight from Desolace to Freewind Post; the Shimmering Flats (the Mirage Raceway
# goblins and gnomes); the road south to Gadgetzan; a loop east of Gadgetzan (Steamwheedle Port, the
# Wastewander camps, the gnomish garbage on the way back); Gadgetzan to finish.

guide Tanaris (43-43)
faction horde
levels 43 43
carry 243 1117 1137 1183 1261 2864 2872 95033 95296
leave 1118 1261 95033
next Dustwallow Marsh (43-44)
# Marg Speaks (1261): taken in Stranglethorn (guide 2), handed in at Brackenwall (guide 5).

# Desolace to Thousand Needles ------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Desolace
fly "Freewind Post, Thousand Needles" npc 6726
tip The flight crosses Thunder Bluff. Already know Gadgetzan? Fly there instead and do the Shimmering Flats at the end, riding north out of Tanaris.

# The Shimmering Flats: the Mirage Raceway ---------------------------------------------------------

map Thousand Needles
goto "Ride east from Freewind Post down to the salt flats and the Mirage Raceway, in the middle of the Shimmering Flats" at 78.6,76.8 r 40
turnin 1117
accept 1118
tip Back to Booty Bay is handed in by the Stranglethorn Vale (46-47) guide: keep it.
tip Kravel's next errand, Back to Booty Bay, belongs to a later guide: leave it for now.
turnin 1137
turnin 1183
accept 1186 1190
turnin 1186
tip Razzeric's Tweaking is for a later guide: leave it.
note "Talk to Zamek and let him set off his distraction: Rizzle Brassbolts runs out to look" npc 4709 at 79.8,76.9
tip Zamek offers the distraction as a short quest of its own; take it and he does the rest.
turnin 1190
tip While Rizzle is away, his plans lie unguarded in the Brassbolts' workshop. If he is back, ask Zamek again.
accept 1194
turnin 1194
tip The Indurium Ore quest that follows is not in these guides.

# Gadgetzan ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Tanaris
goto "Ride south out of the Shimmering Flats on the road into Tanaris and on to Gadgetzan" at 52.0,27.5 r 30
fpath 7824 at 51.6,25.4
tip Bulkrek Ragefist, the wind rider master, stands at the north edge of town.
turnin 2864
tip Tran'rek's Scarab Shells is for a later guide.
accept 97534 at 51.1,27.9
turnin 243
accept 379 1690
accept 1707
bind 7733
tip The innkeeper stands inside the inn.

# East of Gadgetzan: Steamwheedle Port and the Wastewander camps ----------------------------------

do 97534 bg
tip The Gnomish Garbage piles lie all over the sand around Gadgetzan: loot them whenever you pass one.
turnin 2872
tip Stoley is inside the building. His shipment quest is for a later guide.
turnin 95296
tip Shipping and Handling, from Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port. Its follow-up is for Tanaris & Dustwallow Marsh (47-48).
do 379 bg at 64.4,32.8
do 1690
tip The bandits and thieves fill the camp south of Steamwheedle Port. The shadow mages and assassins further south-west hit harder and are not needed.
do 1707 at 64.4,32.8 "Collect 10 Wastewander Water Pouches: Slake That Thirst and Water Pouch Bounty each take 5"
tip Every Wastewander drops pouches. The quest log counts only 5, so keep killing until the bags hold 10, and don't sell them.
do 97534
tip Loot the garbage piles south of Gadgetzan on the way back.

# Gadgetzan ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 97534 at 51.1,27.9
turnin 379 1690
turnin 1707
note "For the next guide, take the flight to Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh if you know it" npc 7824 at 51.6,25.4
